#!/usr/bin/env vml
# ============================================================================
#   Pat: the driver and the accountant for your news. Tell him about a
#   product, and the channels you post on (Mastodon, Bluesky, dev.to, a
#   Facebook Page; and Quora, Reddit, Hacker News, LinkedIn and X, where you
#   post yourself), and he drafts a post for each, shaped for it. Nothing
#   goes out until you've changed it as you like and approved it. Then he
#   keeps the books: what each post earned, per channel and per product.
#
#   The books: ~/.vml/pat/pat.db (SQLite: yours, plain tables). The talking
#   to the platforms: tools/pat/pat.py, in the repo (PAT_REPO, or the
#   pat_repo preference; ~/projects/vml-github unless you say).
#
#   Made with Visualised.
# ============================================================================

@Window Pat
Title=Pat
Version=1.0
AppBar=true
About=Pat posts your news, and keeps the books on what it earned.
Icon=pat.png
TitleBar=Own
BorderBrush=#B91C1C
BorderThickness=2
Accent=#B91C1C
Width=820
Height=660
MinWidth=820
MinHeight=660
OnOpened=Opened

@Canvas c
Parent=Pat
Background=#F5F5F4

@Canvas head
Parent=c
Canvas.Left=0
Canvas.Top=0
Width=820
Height=76
Background=#B91C1C
